### Lab 3 – REST examples (VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ HTTP client)
### Synthetic data only. Set preferredDate to a future date.
@app = http://localhost:8083

### 1. Submit an appointment request (creates a process instance)
POST {{app}}/api/appointment-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "AR-TC01",
  "patientRef": "SYN-PAT-0001",
  "patientAge": 34,
  "department": "GENERAL_MEDICINE",
  "preferredDate": "2026-11-03",
  "preferredTimeOfDay": "MORNING",
  "symptomsSummary": "Synthetic: mild cough for 3 days",
  "painScore": 2,
  "symptomDurationDays": 3,
  "chestPain": false,
  "breathingDifficulty": false,
  "severeBleeding": false,
  "highFever": false
}

# Response 201:
# {"processInstanceKey": 2251799813687422, "processDefinitionVersion": 1, "requestId": "AR-TC01"}

### 2. Mock scheduling API – slot search (the call the REST Connector makes)
GET {{app}}/api/scheduling/slots?department=GENERAL_MEDICINE&fromDate=2026-11-02&timeOfDay=MORNING&withinDays=3
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: AR-DEMO

# Response 200:
# {"department":"GENERAL_MEDICINE","fromDate":"2026-11-02","withinDays":3,"slots":[
#   {"slotId":"GEN-20261103-0900","start":"2026-11-03T09:00","clinician":"Dr Synthetic A"},
#   {"slotId":"GEN-20261103-1030","start":"2026-11-03T10:30","clinician":"Dr Synthetic B"},
#   {"slotId":"GEN-20261104-0900","start":"2026-11-04T09:00","clinician":"Dr Synthetic B"},
#   {"slotId":"GEN-20261104-1030","start":"2026-11-04T10:30","clinician":"Dr Synthetic C"},
#   {"slotId":"GEN-20261105-0900","start":"2026-11-05T09:00","clinician":"Dr Synthetic C"}]}

### 3. Fully booked department
GET {{app}}/api/scheduling/slots?department=DERMATOLOGY&fromDate=2026-11-02&timeOfDay=AFTERNOON&withinDays=14

# Response 200: {"department":"DERMATOLOGY","fromDate":"2026-11-02","withinDays":14,"slots":[]}

### 4. Book a slot (the call the lab3-book-appointment worker makes)
POST {{app}}/api/scheduling/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slotId": "GEN-20261105-0900", "patientRef": "SYN-PAT-0099", "requestId": "AR-DEMO" }

# Response 200: {"bookingId":"BK-8C4D4ADD","slotId":"GEN-20261105-0900","patientRef":"SYN-PAT-0099","status":"CONFIRMED"}
# Same slot again -> 409 Conflict

### 5. Simulate the scheduling outage / corrective action
PUT {{app}}/api/mock/scheduling/available/false
###
PUT {{app}}/api/mock/scheduling/available/true
